\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-15.0789em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.5136em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-18.9215em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.5136em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-23.8273em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.5136em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-25.0273em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:13.5136em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:11.0136em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:12.2536em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
