  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4b. The identification: contamination per unit signal is affine in $\\tau_c=t_2(\\theta_1+h)$\nThe affine search (above) singles out $\\tau_c$, the untwisted eigenvalue of $t_2$ at $u=\\theta_1+h$. It ties with $t_2(\\theta_2+h)$; at $h=1$ that is $u=t+1$. $\\hat k_{(1,1)}$ itself is not simple, but $K_{(1,1)}/S_{\\rm ref}=\\hat k_{(1,1)}\\rho$ is. This cell tests the explicit formulas at all 25 values of $t$ (fit **and** held-out), for both copies:\n$$\\frac{K_{(3,2)}}{S}=\\rho_c=\\frac{19t(t-1)-\\tau_c}{27t},\\qquad \\frac{K_{(1,1)}}{S}=\\frac{4t(t-1)(3t-23)-(3t-11)\\tau_c}{1296\\,t},\\qquad \\hat s_{(2,2),c}=\\frac{4t(t-1)-\\tau_c}{24t},$$\nand the resulting clean combination on copy $c$:\n$$v_c=48\\,[19t(t-1)-\\tau_c]\\,d_{(1,1)}-[4t(t-1)(3t-23)-(3t-11)\\tau_c]\\,d_{(3,2)}\\qquad(\\text{plus any multiple of }6d_{(1,1)}-d_{(2,2)}).$$\nThe same search is repeated for $[5,2,1]$, whose signal directions are copy-dependent too.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "tsAll = tAll;\ntauC[μ_, c_] := Ec[μ, iTau, c];\nchk = Table[With[{τ = tauC[{4, 3, 1}, c], tt = tsAll, k = yc[{4, 3, 1}, 1, c], r = yc[{4, 3, 1}, 2 nL + 1, c], s = yc[{4, 3, 1}, nL + 2, c]},\n    {c, Max[Abs[r - (19 tt (tt - 1) - τ)/(27 tt)]], Max[Abs[k r - (4 tt (tt - 1) (3 tt - 23) - (3 tt - 11) τ)/(1296 tt)]], Max[Abs[s - (4 tt (tt - 1) - τ)/(24 tt)]],\n     Max[Abs[Table[With[{v = {48 (19 tt[[i]] (tt[[i]] - 1) - τ[[i]]), 0, -(4 tt[[i]] (tt[[i]] - 1) (3 tt[[i]] - 23) - (3 tt[[i]] - 11) τ[[i]])}}, v . dataE[[i]][{{4, 3, 1}, c}][[1 ;; nL]]/Norm[v]], {i, Length[tt]}]]],\n     Min[Abs[Table[With[{v = {48 (19 tt[[i]] (tt[[i]] - 1) - τ[[i]]), 0, -(4 tt[[i]] (tt[[i]] - 1) (3 tt[[i]] - 23) - (3 tt[[i]] - 11) τ[[i]])}}, v . dataE[[i]][{{4, 3, 1}, c}][[nL + 1 ;; 2 nL]]/Norm[v]], {i, Length[tt]}]]]}], {c, 2}];\n(* [5,2,1]: affine forms of its signal directions in τ *)\naff521 = Table[With[{y1 = yc[{5, 2, 1}, j, 1], y2 = yc[{5, 2, 1}, j, 2]}, With[{B = (y1 - y2)/(tauC[{5, 2, 1}, 1] - tauC[{5, 2, 1}, 2])}, With[{A = y1 - B tauC[{5, 2, 1}, 1]}, With[{fa = ratFit[A], fb = ratFit[B]}, {\"s\" <> ToString[locShapes[[j - nL]]], fa[[1]], fb[[1]], fa[[2]] + fb[[2]], Max[fa[[3]], fb[[3]]]}]]]], {j, {nL + 1, nL + 2}}];\n(* the eigenvalue itself: τ1 + τ2 and τ1 τ2 *)\ntauSym = Table[{μ, ratFit[tauC[μ, 1] + tauC[μ, 2]][[1]], ratFit[tauC[μ, 1] tauC[μ, 2]][[1]]}, {μ, secsE}];\nColumn[{Grid[Join[{{\"[4,3,1] copy\", \"max |ρ - formula|\", \"max |K11/S - formula|\", \"max |s22 - formula|\", \"max |v_c·k-hat| (contamination of v_c)\", \"min |v_c·s-hat| (signal of v_c)\"}}, Map[N[#, 3] &, chk, {2}]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n  Grid[Join[{{\"[5,2,1] target\", \"a(t)\", \"b(t)  (y = a + b τ)\", \"total degree\", \"validation\"}}, aff521], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n  Grid[Join[{{\"sector\", \"τ1 + τ2\", \"τ1 τ2\"}}, tauSym], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
